  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/anxiety-vret#">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>AnxietyVRET_v21.1</rdfs:label>
    <owl:versionInfo>v21.1</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment>v21.1 — Implementation aligned with the rule layer described in the thesis and manuscript (Rules 1–6): GAD-7 severity rules re-encoded as Rules 3–6 on gad7TotalScore (MinimalAnxiety, MildAnxiety, ModerateAnxiety, SevereAnxiety), replacing the earlier three-level hasRiskLevel rules; SWRL variables of the heart-rate rules (Rules 1–2) declared as swrl:Variable so that the rules execute; float range removed from predictedAnxietyLevel. No classes or properties were added or removed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Previous version note: v21 — Aligned with thesis v21: fixed namespace inconsistencies; consolidated 6-stage model as individuals; added VR_Event vocabulary for JSONL event logging (stage_change, trigger_shown, text_shown, object_interaction, system_command, safety_event); clarified optional survey scales (PQ, SSQ).</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="http://example.org/anxiety-vret/v21.1"/>
    <owl:priorVersion rdf:resource="http://example.org/anxiety-vret/v21"/>
  </rdf:Description>
